# Decrypted secrets must never reach git. The repository holds them only encrypted
# (*.enc.env) next to the templates that name their variables (*.example.env); every
# other file in infra/secrets is a plaintext copy someone made while editing, and a local
# stack's throwaway secrets live in .dev.
.dev/
secrets/*
!secrets/*.enc.env
!secrets/*.example.env
!secrets/README.md
